==Battleground==
*1 [[Mega Cat (Enemy)|Mega Cat]] spawns as the boss after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mega Cat EX (Enemy)|Mega Cat EX]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**15 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Taking care of the first Mega Cat is no problem, but the EX version can prove a bit of a challenge. You should try to focus on killing the peons as fast as possible, and then deal with Mega Cat EX afterwards. It has a smaller TBA than its counterpart, so you'll need to be careful on timing your [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical hitting units]].

